                <start-time>00:07:44,550</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:46,875</end-time>
                <translation>吉本在个人幻想中</translation>
                <original>吉本は個人幻想に</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="125" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:07:46,875</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:49,150</end-time>
                <translation>找到了能够抵抗共同幻想的
共同幻想に抵抗し得る</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="126" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:07:49,150</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:52,575</end-time>
                <translation>的一个位置 可以这么说</translation>
                <original>まあ場所を見出していくわけですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="127" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:07:52,575</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:54,825</end-time>
                <translation>找到了对于共同幻想
共同幻想に対して</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="128" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:07:54,825</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:56,600</end-time>
                <translation>能够与之逆立的可能性</translation>
                <original>それを逆立できる可能性があるのが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="129" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:07:56,600</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:58,250</end-time>
                <translation>只存在于自我幻想之中 这一点</translation>
                <original>自己幻想のみだまでは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="130" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:07:58,250</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:59,260</end-time>
                <translation>我还是可以理解的</translation>
                <original>まあ分かります</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="131" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:07:59,260</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:02,400</end-time>
                <translation>只是如果方式不对 他就会选择自杀</translation>
                <original>ただ変なやり方だと自死を選んじゃうところですもんね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="132" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:08:02,400</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:04,400</end-time>
                <translation>自杀虽然也能获得解放</translation>
                <original>自死も解放はされるんですけど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="133" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:08:04,400</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:06,675</end-time>
                <translation>但那并不是人们所期望的</translation>
                <original>望んではいませんからねそれは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="134" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:08:06,675</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:10,625</end-time>
                <translation>关于这一点 《共同幻想论》中有明确的说法吗？</translation>
                <original>それは共同幻想論にこうしようというのははっきりあるんですか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="135" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:08:10,625</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:12,780</end-time>
                <translation>遗憾的是 《共同幻想论》中
残念ながら共同幻想論には</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="136" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:08:12,780</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:16,000</end-time>
                <translation>并没有对个人幻想究竟是什么</translation>
                <original>この個人幻想というのはどういうものであるというふうに</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="137" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:08:16,000</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:18,800</end-time>
                <translation>进行详细解说的部分</translation>
                <original>詳しく解説した部分はないんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="138" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:08:18,800</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:20,360</end-time>
                <translation>啊 那就是没有答案么</translation>
                <original>あら答えがない感じですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="139" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:08:20,360</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:22,675</end-time>
                <translation>是的 这正是这部著作</translation>
                <original>そうなんですねそれがこの著作をですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="140" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:08:22,675</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:25,825</end-time>
