                <original>講演録といったものを参考にして</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="143" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:08:31,800</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:35,195</end-time>
                <translation>来了解其内容</translation>
                <original>その内容を知ることができるということになりますね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="144" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:08:37,600</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:42,075</end-time>
                <translation>在越南战争日趋激烈的1966年</translation>
                <original>ベトナム戦争が激しさを増す1966年に</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="145" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:08:42,075</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:45,325</end-time>
                <translation>他在大学举行的一场演讲
大学で行われた講演</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="146" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:08:45,325</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:47,520</end-time>
                <translation>《自立的思想据点》</translation>
                <original>自立の思想的拠点</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="147" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:08:49,670</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:51,000</end-time>
                <translation>在这里 吉本</translation>
                <original>ここで吉本は</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="148" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:08:51,000</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:56,350</end-time>
                <translation>对以资本主义阵营与社会主义阵营的对立为背景展开的
資本主義陣営と社会主義陣営の対立を背景に行われている</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="149" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:08:56,350</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:00,650</end-time>
                <translation>越南反战运动进行了彻底批判
ベトナム反戦運動を通列に批判</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="150" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:09:00,650</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:04,600</end-time>
                <translation>认为这作为与国家权力抗争的运动来说是不充分的
国家権力に抗う運動としては不十分だと</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="151" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:09:04,600</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:08,620</end-time>
                <translation>他提出了本质意义上的“自立”这一概念</translation>
                <original>本質的な意味での自立という概念を打ち出しました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="152" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:09:12,660</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:15,100</end-time>
                <translation>从大众中在知性上有所提升
大衆から知的に上昇し</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="153" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:09:15,100</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:19,175</end-time>
                <translation>那些满脑子都是欧美知识的所谓知识阶层</translation>
                <original>欧米の知識で頭をいっぱいにしているような知識陣を</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="154" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:09:19,175</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:21,725</end-time>
                <translation>吉本并不予以肯定</translation>
                <original>吉本は評価しません</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="155" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:09:21,725</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:24,450</end-time>
                <translation>但反过来像芥川那样</translation>
                <original>しかし芥川のように</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="156" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:09:24,450</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:26,880</end-time>
                <translation>彻底地对知性保持诚实
徹底的に知性に誠実であれば</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="157" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:09:26,880</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:30,125</end-time>
                <translation>就无法对任何地方产生归属感</translation>
                <original>どこにも所属意識を持てず</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="158" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:09:30,125</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:32,280</end-time>
                <translation>甚至可能被逼上自杀的道路
