                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="159" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:09:36,130</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:38,050</end-time>
                <translation>另一方面 大众
一方の大衆は</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="160" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:09:38,050</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:42,475</end-time>
                <translation>只对自己的生活圈感兴趣</translation>
                <original>自分の生活圏にしか興味を抱きません</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="161" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:09:42,475</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:48,050</end-time>
                <translation>光是考虑明天怎么卖蔬菜和鱼就已经竭尽全力了</translation>
                <original>明日野菜や魚をどう売ろうかということで精一杯であり</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="162" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:09:48,050</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:52,810</end-time>
                <translation>他们只关心生活节奏的重复</translation>
                <original>生活のリズムを繰り返すことにのみ関心を持ちます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
