                <start-time>00:11:09,140</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:13,372</end-time>
                <translation>这是我爷爷说过的话</translation>
                <original>これはうちのおじいちゃんが言っていた</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="180" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:11:13,372</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:15,808</end-time>
                <translation>“觉得战争会输 是因为</translation>
                <original>「戦争を負けるなと思ったのは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="181" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:11:15,808</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:20,022</end-time>
