            <t index="313" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:18:50,713</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:52,567</end-time>
                <translation>最基本的一点是</translation>
                <original>まず基本的なことは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="314" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:18:52,567</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:54,712</end-time>
                <translation>人就像相扑一样</translation>
                <original>人間というのは相撲と同じで</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="315" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:18:54,712</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:57,111</end-time>
                <translation>每天都在过着紧张的日子</translation>
                <original>緊張の日々をですね過ごしている</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="316" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:18:57,111</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:00,128</end-time>
                <translation>或者说 每一天都是紧张的连续</translation>
                <original>あるいは日々というのは緊張の連続であると</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="317" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:19:00,128</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:01,974</end-time>
                <translation>也就是说 活着这件事</translation>
                <original>つまり生きるということは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="318" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:19:01,974</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:06,544</end-time>
                <translation>就是用埋头苦干去处理一个接一个出现的课题</translation>
                <original>力技でですね起きてくる課題を一つ一つ処理して</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="319" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:19:06,544</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:09,548</end-time>
                <translation>然后终其一生与各种事情</translation>
                <original>そして生涯そのいろいろなこととですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="320" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:19:09,548</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:11,524</end-time>
                <translation>扭打在一起 大汗淋漓</translation>
                <original>四つに組んで大汗を流して</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="321" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:19:11,524</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:14,251</end-time>
                <translation>最后像倒下一样死去</translation>
                <original>最後はですね倒れるように死んでいくと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="322" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:19:14,251</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:17,089</end-time>
                <translation>这或许就是人的本质</translation>
                <original>まあこれが人間の本質なんじゃないかというですね</original>
