                <start-time>00:19:21,957</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:25,174</end-time>
                <translation>实际上 我们的人生</translation>
                <original>こうしたですね実は我々の人生というのは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="325" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:19:25,174</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:28,534</end-time>
                <translation>无论是遇到地震还是病毒</translation>
                <original>地震であれウイルスであれですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="326" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:19:28,534</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:33,717</end-time>
                <translation>不断克服一个又一个困难 这不就是人生吗</translation>
